---
title: "Backtester daily loop"
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant scheduler as Scheduler
    participant engine as Backtest engine
    participant market as Market data
    participant strategy as Strategy
    participant broker as Sim broker
    participant ledger as Ledger
    loop for each trading day
        scheduler->>engine: run_day(date)
        engine->>market: load_chain(date)
        market-->>engine: option quotes
        engine->>engine: mark_to_market(book)
        Note right of engine: marks at mid = (bid + ask) / 2
        engine->>strategy: on_bar(chain, book)
        strategy-->>engine: target orders
        alt orders not empty
            engine-)broker: submit(orders)
            broker-->>engine: fills incl. slippage + fees
            engine->>ledger: record_fills(fills)
        else no orders
            engine->>engine: skip execution
        end
        engine->>ledger: write daily_pnl + greeks
        Note right of ledger: one row per open position
        engine-->>scheduler: day summary
    end
